# Root build context is the repo root (so libs/ is reachable by every service
# image). Keep the context small — never ship venvs, node_modules, or git into
# the daemon. Explicit COPY lines in each Dockerfile pull only what they need.
**/venv/
**/.venv/
**/node_modules/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/*.egg-info/
.git/
.github/
**/*.db
**/*.sqlite3
**/logs/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.env
*.md
*.html
docs/
Trainee_Codebase/
